This folder contains all code related to ARG-inference of 60 maize lines and 51 teosinte lines. Used bash scripts to extract recombination breakpoints and branch lengths.
ARG_recombinationrate_analysis_plots.R details how to process recombination breakpoints and branch lengths over MCMC iterations to find average recombination rates per specified bin size.

ARGweaver_script.txt is an example of parallelization of ARGweaver in 1Mb chunks on teosinte chromosome 1.
RTH_extract.sh is a bash script to extract RTH values-- used to detect selection throughout the ARG-- per chromosome.
zero_shot_score.R details how to process zero-shot score dataset. Output from ARG_recombinationrate_analysis_plots.R is needed to calculate zero-shot score per specified bin size.
